; Print "<object> is <state>" for the object in IY
;
; Loads the first name phrase (+8) of the record in IY and joins #R$A172, which
; prints a message such as "The door is closed." with the state word chosen by
; the id in A (see #R$A16C).
;
; A State id (bit 7 selects the second word table)
; IY Record of the object
@label=PrintStateIY
c$A164 LD L,(IY+$08)
 $A167 LD H,(IY+$09)
 $A16A JR $A172
